WEBVTT

00:00:00.285 --> 00:00:03.993
A browser journey failed because the
Checkout button never appeared.

00:00:04.164 --> 00:00:07.345
Let's look at what Playwright saw and what
the browser called.

00:00:07.885 --> 00:00:10.469
Open the replay report and select Journeys.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.287
The badge counts failed journeys.

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:14.645
Expand the test that failed to see the

00:00:14.645 --> 00:00:17.235
actions and assertions in the order they
ran.

00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:19.387
Scroll to the failure files.

00:00:19.558 --> 00:00:23.773
The screenshot shows the demo shop and its
items, with no Checkout button.

00:00:23.944 --> 00:00:26.766
Select Open trace to see where the journey
stopped.

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:31.952
In the trace viewer, select the failed
visibility assertion under Go to checkout.

00:00:32.123 --> 00:00:34.713
Check the page snapshot and the locator to

00:00:34.713 --> 00:00:37.857
confirm what the test expected to see at
that step.

00:00:38.419 --> 00:00:42.218
Return to the journey steps to see the
requests tied to each action.

00:00:42.389 --> 00:00:44.463
In this separate run, the items call

00:00:44.463 --> 00:00:47.344
returned a different JSON body from the
recording.

00:00:47.515 --> 00:00:50.619
The report lists the difference under the
step that made the call.

00:00:51.185 --> 00:00:53.698
Use the trace to see what the browser did

00:00:53.698 --> 00:00:56.394
and the report to see what the API
returned.
